+     said in full (LV, SP), and the words and Pokémon names the guess got wrong
+  2. the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary, through the Python package cmudict
+     (c) Carnegie Mellon University, BSD licence, http://www.speech.cs.cmu.edu/cgi-bin/cmudict
