+// Hän support: reads one letter together with any grave, diaeresis or ogonek
+// attached to it (typed precomposed, as combining marks, or any mix) and
+// returns one lookup code for the whole letter. Characters without those
+// marks come back exactly as DecodeUtf8 returns them.
+const std::int32_t kMarkedLetterFlag = 0x200000;
+UnicodeChar DecodeUtf8WithMarks(const char* s);
+
